<title>IRAN: Iran switching to winter time on Friday.</title>
<headline>Iran switching to winter time on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TEHRAN 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran switches to winter time at midnight (1930 GMT) on Friday, September 20, turning the clocks back by one hour, Tehran radio said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Iranian time will then be three hours and 30 minutes ahead of GMT.</p>
</text>
